WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.241
Your containers leave every day, and not all of them come back. How many? Where? Since when?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.283
Every container that crosses the gate gets logged. On its own.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.056
You see how many sit at each plant, and with each customer.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.345
If any have been out too long, you're alerted… and someone owns it.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.125
The customer says they sent them back? The history shows how many are still there.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.806
Horizon Containers. Every container that doesn't come back is money nobody is counting.
